{
  "evidence_boundary": "Descriptive post-capture ship-candidate inventory only. Capture rows come from the production capture differential. The prize ship's presence is anchored by that independently validated capture event; all other site membership is reconstructed independently from T-1 state. Ordinary ships use the existing owner-current position path; Tow/Intercept ships use the independently validated production-phase special-movement overlay. Multiple capture continuations at one site remain separate observations. For each foreign predicted ship, its T-1 Kill!/Primary-Enemy request is reevaluated against the prize ship's new owner, and strict diplomacy permission removes factual rows for the exact candidate pair so the held-out next engagement cannot prove its own permission. Factual VCR N+1 contributes only the opponent ship id comparator after candidates are built. This v3 does not yet apply active-membership history before the capture, rebuild captured-ship aggression, or promote a next-pair rule.",
